# Hub web development

Locked: `dc-web-stack`, `dc-leaf-cycle`, `dc-leaf-contract`, `dc-design-defaults`. Handbook: [`docs/WEB_DEVELOPMENT.md`](docs/WEB_DEVELOPMENT.md).

- **New UI** = Next App Router + React + TS + Tailwind + SG tokens. No new Vite/CRA/Next repo. No MUI/shadcn/Bootstrap/MD3 on hub pages.
- **Leaf cycle:** dummy → `sketched` shell + plan → `building` skeleton (same store types) → `live` → version **number + datetime**.
- **Chrome:** `AppShell` (WIP desk yellow badge when `WIP_DESK` is set, Train version → Train Changelog, Hotfix chip only on hotfix, Home, Site network, Feedback → one register, Profile), `PageNav`. Starting classes: `sg-card`, `sg-btn-primary` / `secondary` / `ghost` / `action`, `sg-input`. Feedback popup footer: Save primary, Cancel secondary, Open Inbox `sg-btn-action` right-aligned — always shown.
- Hex = **badge only** unless a ThemeContract. Dialogs: viewport-capped (PLATFORM / EffortPopupShell).
- How to take requests: product behaviour, not “edit the HTML file.”
- Preview on **this desk’s port** (`docs/YARD_DESKS.md`). Station `:3000`. WIP `:3001+`. Match `AUTH_URL`. Never send a wip sitting to `localhost:3000`.
